      "instance_name": "Adolf_Hitler",
      "label": "historical figure",
      "description": "A black-and-white portrait of Adolf Hitler, the German dictator and architect of the Holocaust, shown with his characteristic mustache and uniform. He is the central and only person depicted in the image, and his presence is the primary visual material. The image is a historical photograph, not a modern depiction, and his expression is serious and direct, contrasting with the humorous text overlay.",
